        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="sub" value="data flows bottom → top · solid border = exists in RTA.py · dashed = to build" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fontSize=13;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="240" y="60" width="920" height="34" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="changes" value="&lt;b&gt;What changed vs. the v2 diagram&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1 · “+” → concat on the sequence axis, with type + position embeddings&lt;br&gt;2 · learned meta-evaluator → external verifier (ground truth) + selector&lt;br&gt;3 · halt head trained on verifier labels; z-cosine is only a feature&lt;br&gt;4 · gate before any database write; failures are quarantined in d_fail&lt;br&gt;5 · facts enter as tokens with identifiers; as_of is resolved before the model&lt;br&gt;6 · Δz decoding → linear probe on pooled z (page 3)&lt;br&gt;7 · deep supervision + detach instead of full backpropagation through time (page 3)" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;strokeWidth=2;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=13;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;spacingTop=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
